<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0699_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kenny</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Same opponent, same homies,\nbut the scrap go different\fevery time!\rI’d like to scrap you again.\nLet’s swap numbers!{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Once I’m ready, I’ll give you\na call!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see... Well, that’s fine by me.\nI always got my mountain!\fThe mountain never rejects me.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d like to scrap you again.\nLet’s swap numbers! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s weird...\nI can hear you SO clear...\rWait, you right nearby, ain’t you!\nLet’s talk in person!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Homies take a likin’ to us nature-lovin’\nHikers easy!\rNah, nah, it ain’t in my head!\nI got PROOF! My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}\fNEVER disobey me!\fIt’s afraid of me. Same thing.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, listen up!\rYesterday I ran into a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}!\nJust out in nature!\rMy homies was in top form. It all\nhappened so NATURAL!\rHow do I describe this feelin’...\nHow do I put it into words?\fWell, for now...\rHOOOORAY!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A few days ago, hikin’, a wild\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} jumped out at me!\rI wasn’t ready AT ALL, and it dipped.\rHikers bet our LIFE on bein’ ready, so\nI gotta count this as a L.\fI’m takin’ a nap on a rock to recover.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We ABSOLUTELY gotta scrap\nagain!\fThat’s why we talkin’ right now!\rAm I right? I hope I’m!\nI’ll be waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We scrappin’ on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, remember. I’m out\fhere, waitin’ in the middle of nature!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0699_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s right... I’m on this mountain\nbasically the whole year...\rBaths?\rAin’t no such thing on a mountain!\rI just find a river and wash off.\rA few days ago, when I was bathin’ in\nthe river, somebody thought I was a\fSwimmer♂!\fThey gave me a medal. I kept it.</language>
	</row>
</body>
